{
  "overview": "A general-purpose NestJS REST API boilerplate offering swappable persistence (TypeORM/Postgres or Mongoose/MongoDB), JWT authentication, file uploads to S3, transactional email, internationalization, and Docker-based end-to-end test tooling, aimed at bootstrapping production NestJS services quickly.",
